Description: Linux 7.2 kernel for RISC OS on Linux on UEFI machines and Pinebooks
 The Linux kernel UEFI machines (UTM, QEMU, ARM boards and servers) and
 Pine64's Pinebook and Pinebook Pro start (EFI/BOOT/BOOTAA64.EFI on the
 card's FAT partition), with the Pinebooks' device trees. Installing it
 copies them onto the FAT partition, keeping the old ones as *.old; a
 restart starts the new kernel.
