Description: RISC OS 5.31 for RISC OS on Linux
 RISC OS itself (its ROM image, /opt/riscos/RISCOS.IMG), built from RISC
 OS Open's sources with Timothy Baldwin's Linux port. RISC OS starts the
 new one at its next start. The one it replaces is kept in
 /opt/riscos/rollback: a file called ROLLBACK on the card's FAT partition
 puts it back at the next start.
